11.3.3 代价函数 (cost function: square error cost function)
model: fw,b(x)=wx+b , w,b: parameters (w: slope, b: intercept)
\(J(w,b) = \frac{1}{2m} \sum_{i=1}^{m} (\hat{y}^{(i)} - y^{(i)})^2\): 评价模型预测得好不好
(hat{y}-y): error (how far off the prediction is from the target)
m: number of training examples
12.3.4 代价函数的直观理解
Linear regression model:
\(J(w,b) = \frac{1}{2m} \sum_{i=1}^{m} (\（wx+b)^{(i)} - y^{(i)})^2\): f数值越小，模型预测得越好
goal: minize J(w,b) to find the best w and b to make the model predict as accurately as possible:
when m=3, b=0, w=1, J(w,b)=0, when b=0, w=0.5, J(w, b)=0.58,
when m=3, b=0, w=0, J(w,b)=2.3
choose w to minize J(w)
