91.16.2 选择拆分信息增益(choose a split information gain)
> choose a split: 
1) compute the purity at each sub node under each root node, p1^left，p1^right and the relevant entropy H(p1^left), H(p1^right)
2) compute the weighted average of purity at each sub node under each root node, (H(p1^root)-[number of example in left node/number of example in root node)*H(p1^left)+(number of example in right node/number of example in root node)*H(p1^right)]
> information gain:
information gain=H(p1^root)-(w^left*H(p1^left)+w^right*H(p1^right))
#IG=H(root)-Weighted Child entropy 
# information gain is a measure of the reduction in entropy achieved by splitting the data on a particular feature 
# information gain larger, the better, because it means that the split results in a more pure distribution of classes in the child nodes
# IG测量的是相比切之前，纯了多少，不是切完以后纯不纯，因为decision tree的目标是让每个叶子节点尽可能纯，所以我们希望切完以后纯度高，信息增益大
